<title>USA: Banc One Corp sets $500 mln in bonds.</title>
<headline>Banc One Corp sets $500 mln in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Banc One was priced on Thursday, according to co-manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANC ONE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	COUPON 7.625 PCT  MATURITY 10/15/2026</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	  ISS PRICE 99.191  FIRST PAY DATE 04/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A1     YIELD  7.694 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS   SPREAD +80 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: OLD 30-YEAR BOND</p>
<p>--Corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
